<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to Tonitel HMS - Your Institution is Ready</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f2f5f7;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #1f2937;
        }
        .email-wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }
        .email-container {
            max-width: 620px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #e5eaf0;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #19417D;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 36px 32px;
        }
        .header .brand-mark {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            background-color: #00DFA2;
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin-right: 8px;
        }
        .header .eyebrow {
            font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #A9C6E8;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .header h1 {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-top: 10px;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 36px 32px;
        }
        .greeting {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #1f2937;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .intro-text {
            font-size: 14.5px;
            color: #4b5563;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .intro-text strong {
            color: #19417D;
        }
        .institution-card {
            background-color: #F4FBF8;
            border: 1px solid #CCF2E3;
            border-left: 4px solid #00DFA2;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 18px 20px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .institution-card .label {
            font-size: 11px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #0FA477;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
        .institution-card .name {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #19417D;
        }
        .institution-card .code {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #4b5563;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }
        .section-title {
            font-size: 13px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #19417D;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }
        .credentials-box {
            background-color: #F8FAFC;
            border: 1px solid #E5EAF0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 6px 20px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .credential-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 14px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #E5EAF0;
        }
        .credential-row:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .credential-label {
            font-size: 13.5px;
            color: #6b7280;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .credential-value {
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            border: 1px solid #dbe2ea;
            font-size: 13.5px;
            color: #19417D;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .notice {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            background-color: #FFF8EC;
            border: 1px solid #F5E3BE;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }
        .notice p {
            font-size: 13.5px;
            color: #92600E;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .notice p strong {
            color: #7A4E08;
        }
        .cta-wrap {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 28px 0;
        }
        .login-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #00DFA2;
            color: #0B2E52;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 14px 36px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 15px;
        }
        .support-note {
            background-color: #F0F6FC;
            border: 1px solid #DCE9F7;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 14px 16px;
        }
        .support-note p {
            font-size: 13.5px;
            color: #19417D;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .support-note p strong {
            color: #0B2E52;
        }
        .support-note a {
            color: #19417D;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #F8FAFC;
            padding: 22px 32px;
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid #E5EAF0;
        }
        .footer p {
            color: #9AA5B1;
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
        .footer a {
            color: #19417D;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-wrapper">
        <div class="email-container">
            <div class="header">
                <span class="brand-mark"></span><span class="eyebrow">Tonitel Health Systems</span>
                <h1>Your institution is ready</h1>
            </div>

            <div class="content">
                <p class="greeting">Hello, <%= username %>,</p>
                <p class="intro-text">Your institution <strong><%= institutionName %></strong> has been successfully registered on Tonitel HMS. Your admin dashboard is now ready to use.</p>

                <div class="institution-card">
                    <div class="label">Institution</div>
                    <div class="name"><%= institutionName %></div>
                    <div class="code">Institution Code: <strong><%= institutionCode || 'N/A' %></strong></div>
                </div>

                <div class="section-title">Login Credentials</div>
                <div class="credentials-box">
                    <div class="credential-row">
                        <span class="credential-label">Email Address</span>
                        <span class="credential-value"><%= email %></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="credential-row">
                        <span class="credential-label">Password</span>
                        <span class="credential-value"><%= password %></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="credential-row">
                        <span class="credential-label">Institution</span>
                        <span class="credential-value"><%= institutionName %></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="credential-row">
                        <span class="credential-label">Region</span>
                        <span class="credential-value"><%= institutionRegion || 'N/A' %></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="credential-row">
                        <span class="credential-label">Country</span>
                        <span class="credential-value"><%= institutionCountry || 'N/A' %></span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="notice">
                    <p>⚠️ <strong>Security Notice:</strong> For your security, please change your password immediately after your first login. Do not share your credentials with anyone.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="cta-wrap">
                    <a href="<%= frontendUrl %>/login" class="login-button">Login to Your Dashboard →</a>
                </div>

                <div class="support-note">
                    <p>📞 <strong>Need help?</strong> Contact our support team at support@tonitel.com or call +233 30 123 4567.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="footer">
                <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Tonitel HMS. All rights reserved.</p>
                <p>Powered by <a href="https://tonitel.com">Tonitel</a> | Secure Healthcare Management</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>